-- נספח א'4 — טבלת המרה לשכר מורים קיימים - תואר M.A (קוד דירוג 102), מעודכנת החל מיום 1.9.2022: the conversion
-- table of a second-degree (MA) teacher (rating code 102) from 1.9.2022, as the
-- conditions-of-service portal publishes it — a page of the wage
-- agreement of 19.10.2022 as signed, with its hand-written page number and
-- the parties' note that the annexes are agreed. It is annex א4 of that
-- agreement, which §4.1 makes the table from 1.9.2022 and which the
-- agreement's signed copy prints after its signatures (encoded, imported).
-- A conversion table is the salary table with the intermediate grades,
-- "for the conversion only" (the base agreement's §46(א)).
--
-- Checked here over every cell: the table is the signed copy's annex א4
-- cell for cell, and applies from §4.1's day — the page prints none. Its whole grades are the
-- table the follow-up committee's decision of 14.1.2025 (§3, imported)
-- puts in place of annex א2, printed to the agora: the two print the same
-- cell at every seniority and whole grade.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2025-01-14_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakev_taut-sofer-correction_agorot-salary-tables`

§ `נספח א'4 — טבלת המרה לשכר מורים קיימים - תואר M.A (קוד דירוג 102), 1.9.2022`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 The annex's label, "נספח א' 4'"; the table below is that annex.
-- akn:hc_1/p3 The page number written in by hand (7); no rule.

-- The page prints no day under the table, where every other annex of the
-- agreement prints "טבלה מעודכנת החל מיום"; the day is §4.1's, 1.9.2022, the
-- day the signed copy's annex א4 prints.

